#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Code Modifications {#automatic-code-modifications}"
msgstr "Pengubahsuaian Kod Automatik {#automatic-code-modifications}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"doQumentation automatically applies a small number of modifications to upstream\n"
"Qiskit tutorial and guide content to ensure a smooth, interactive experience.\n"
"This page documents every modification so you can understand exactly what\n"
"changed compared to the original IBM Quantum documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"doQumentation secara automatik menerapkan beberapa pengubahsuaian kecil pada kandungan\n"
"tutorial dan panduan Qiskit dari sumber asal untuk memastikan pengalaman yang lancar dan interaktif.\n"
"Halaman ini mendokumentasikan setiap pengubahsuaian supaya anda dapat memahami dengan tepat apa\n"
"yang berubah berbanding dokumentasi IBM Quantum yang asal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notebook copies (Open in Colab / Binder / Code Engine) {#notebook-copies-"
"open-in-colab-binder-code-engine}"
msgstr ""
"Salinan notebook (Buka dalam Colab / Binder / Code Engine) {#notebook-"
"copies-open-in-colab-binder-code-engine}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you click **Open in Colab**, **Open in JupyterLab**, or **Open in Code\n"
"Engine**, you receive a copy of the original notebook with these additions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila anda klik **Open in Colab**, **Open in JupyterLab**, atau **Open in Code\n"
"Engine**, anda akan menerima salinan notebook asal dengan tambahan berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup notice cell (markdown) {#1-setup-notice-cell-markdown}"
msgstr "1. Sel notis persediaan (markdown) {#1-setup-notice-cell-markdown}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A blockquote cell is inserted at the very top explaining that doQumentation\n"
"added an automatic setup cell. It links back to this page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sel blockquote disisipkan di bahagian paling atas yang menerangkan bahawa doQumentation\n"
"telah menambah sel persediaan automatik. Ia menghubungkan semula ke halaman ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Prerequisites cell (code) {#2-prerequisites-cell-code}"
msgstr "2. Sel prasyarat (kod) {#2-prerequisites-cell-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A code cell is inserted after the notice that:\n"
msgstr "Sel kod disisipkan selepas notis yang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Installs required packages** (`qiskit`, `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`,\n"
"`pylatexenc`, plus any tutorial-specific packages detected via import\n"
"scanning). The install is **skipped** if packages are already present\n"
"(e.g. on Binder or Code Engine where they are pre-installed).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Memasang pakej yang diperlukan** (`qiskit`, `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`,\n"
"`pylatexenc`, ditambah mana-mana pakej khusus tutorial yang dikesan melalui\n"
"pengimbasan import). Pemasangan **dilangkau** jika pakej sudah ada\n"
"(cth. pada Binder atau Code Engine di mana ia telah dipasang terlebih dahulu).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Provides a commented-out credentials template** for IBM Quantum, so users\n"
"who want to run on real hardware can uncomment and fill in their API key.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Menyediakan templat kelayakan yang dikomentari** untuk IBM Quantum, supaya pengguna\n"
"yang ingin menjalankan pada perkakasan sebenar boleh membuka komen dan mengisi kunci API mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On Google Colab, this cell auto-runs on notebook open via the\n"
"`cell_execution_strategy: setup` metadata flag.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada Google Colab, sel ini dijalankan secara automatik semasa notebook dibuka melalui\n"
"bendera metadata `cell_execution_strategy: setup`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Image path rewrites {#3-image-path-rewrites}"
msgstr "3. Penulisan semula laluan imej {#3-image-path-rewrites}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Relative image paths (`/docs/images/...`, `/learning/images/...`) are rewritten\n"
"to work correctly in standalone notebook environments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Laluan imej relatif (`/docs/images/...`, `/learning/images/...`) ditulis semula\n"
"supaya berfungsi dengan betul dalam persekitaran notebook berdiri sendiri.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "MDX pages (in-browser rendering) {#mdx-pages-in-browser-rendering}"
msgstr ""
"Halaman MDX (rendering dalam pelayar) {#mdx-pages-in-browser-rendering}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The tutorials displayed on this website are converted from upstream `.ipynb`\n"
"notebooks or `.mdx` files. The following transforms are applied:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial yang dipaparkan di laman web ini ditukar dari notebook `.ipynb` atau fail `.mdx` dari sumber asal.\n"
"Transformasi berikut digunakan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`pip install` lines** are added to Python code blocks that import\n"
"third-party packages, enabling one-click execution via thebelab.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Baris `pip install`** ditambah pada blok kod Python yang mengimport\n"
"pakej pihak ketiga, membolehkan pelaksanaan satu klik melalui thebelab.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Tutorial Survey section**: A note is appended clarifying the survey\n"
"belongs to IBM Quantum and linking to doQumentation's GitHub Issues for\n"
"site-specific feedback.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Bahagian Tinjauan Tutorial IBM**: Nota ditambahkan yang menjelaskan bahawa tinjauan\n"
"tersebut adalah milik IBM Quantum dan menghubungkan ke GitHub Issues doQumentation untuk\n"
"maklum balas khusus laman web.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Feedback widget**: A \"Was this helpful?\" widget is appended at the bottom\n"
"of each tutorial, tracked via privacy-friendly Umami analytics.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Widget maklum balas**: Widget \"Adakah ini membantu?\" ditambahkan di bahagian bawah\n"
"setiap tutorial, dijejak melalui analitik Umami yang mesra privasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**MDX syntax fixes**: Curly braces, heading hierarchy, and JSX compatibility\n"
"issues are automatically corrected for Docusaurus rendering.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pembetulan sintaks MDX**: Pendakap kerinting, hierarki tajuk, dan isu keserasian JSX\n"
"diperbetulkan secara automatik untuk rendering Docusaurus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**OpenInLabBanner**: An interactive banner is injected below the title with\n"
"buttons to open the notebook in Colab, Binder, or Code Engine.\n"
msgstr ""
"**OpenInLabBanner**: Banner interaktif disisipkan di bawah tajuk dengan\n"
"butang untuk membuka notebook dalam Colab, Binder, atau Code Engine.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is NOT modified {#what-is-not-modified}"
msgstr "Apa yang TIDAK diubah {#what-is-not-modified}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The **tutorial content itself** (explanations, code logic, outputs) is never\n"
"altered.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kandungan tutorial itu sendiri** (penjelasan, logik kod, output) tidak pernah\n"
"diubah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Original author attribution** is preserved via frontmatter and the NOTICE\n"
"file (Apache 2.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0 licenses).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Atribusi pengarang asal** dikekalkan melalui frontmatter dan fail NOTICE\n"
"(lesen Apache 2.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**No telemetry or tracking code** is injected into notebooks. Analytics\n"
"(Umami) only runs on the doQumentation website, not in exported notebooks.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tiada kod telemetri atau penjejakan** disisipkan ke dalam notebook. Analitik\n"
"(Umami) hanya berjalan di laman web doQumentation, bukan dalam notebook yang dieksport.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Source code {#source-code}"
msgstr "Kod sumber {#source-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All transformations are implemented in\n"
"[`scripts/sync-content.py`](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/blob/main/scripts/sync-content.py).\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua transformasi dilaksanakan dalam\n"
"[`scripts/sync-content.py`](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/blob/main/scripts/sync-content.py).\n"
